<#5a6ee6>ENJU (ASSIST)</>
Enju High Kick		^X
Enju Dive Kick		_D^X
  Calls Enju when her gauge (the bar with her portrait at the
  bottom of the screen) is full. Cancels from normals on
  contact.

<#5a6ee6>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
Guard Counter (1 bar, while blocking)		_F^A_+^B
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B

<#5a6ee6>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Genmeika		^C after standing ^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#5a6ee6>SPECIALS</>
  C = EX (half a bar); without half a bar C gives the
  heavy version.
Gunfire		_D_DF_F^A (straight) / ^B (down)
  In the air it always fires down.
Unebiko		_F_D_DF^A / ^B
Kasen (hold to charge)		_D_DB_B^A
Uki Rouchou (hold to charge)		_D_DB_B^B
Rokuro Kabuto (hold to charge)		_D_DB_B^C
Shoukahanameishi (air)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B

<#5a6ee6>EX (half a bar)</>
Gunfire EX (ground/air)		_D_DF_F^C
Unebiko Ryuu		_F_D_DF^C
Homura Kasen / Inzen Shoukahanameishi (air)		_D_DB_B^C

<#5a6ee6>SUPERS</>
Unlimited Burst (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
Final Strike (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
Unlimited Burst MAX (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Full-power Unlimited Burst.
